#: view1394.cpp:61
msgid "On the right hand side you can see some information about your IEEE 1394 configuration.<br>The meaning of the columns:<br><b>Name</b>: port or node name, the number can change with each bus reset<br><b>GUID</b>: the 64 bit GUID of the node<br><b>Local</b>: checked if the node is an IEEE 1394 port of your computer<br><b>IRM</b>: checked if the node is isochronous resource manager capable<br><b>CRM</b>: checked if the node is cycle master capable<br><b>ISO</b>: checked if the node supports isochronous transfers<br><b>BM</b>: checked if the node is bus manager capable<br><b>PM</b>: checked if the node is power management capable<br><b>Acc</b>: the cycle clock accuracy of the node, valid from 0 to 100<br><b>Speed</b>: the speed of the node<br>"
msgstr "Uñ yaqta IEEE 1394 caylanuı turında belem kiterelä.<br>Ni turında buy:<br><b>Atama</b>: tuğım awdarılğan sayın port yä töyen adı üzgärelä ala<br><b>GUID</b>: töyenneñ 64 bit GUID<br><b>Cirle</b>: töyen bu sanaqnıñ IEEE 1394 portı bulğan çaqta yanıq tora<br><b>IRM</b>: töyen isochronous digän çığanaq citäkçese belän yaraqlı bulsa yanıq tora<br><b>Bocralı</b>: töyen bocralı osta belän yaraqlı bulsa yanıq tora<br><b>Taşım</b>: töyen isochronous aşa taşımnar totsa yanıq tora<br><b>Tuğım</b>: töyen tuğım citäkçese belän yaraqlı bulsa yanıq tora<br><b>Qüät</b>: töyen qüät citäkläw belän yaraqlı bulsa yanıq tora<br><b>Tögällek</b>: bu töyendäge bocralı säğät tögällege, 0 belän 100 arasında<br><b>Tizlek</b>: toyen tizlege<br>"

